{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_title", "source_sha256": "4770806a80756752d9dd954eca8852b4e1209e90f8a9741252545564753925d6", "ja": "羽ばたいて、大空へと", "zh": "展翅飞翔，飞向苍穹", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0f05628b6bae365b3022305e88ee2ba4c6a45c7cd2de024c16f35d7c5848b0cd", "ja": "首都エリアの最初のツアーもそろそろ終盤、\n最後の公演を控えたゲネプロ当日。メンバー\n達は本番に向け、より良いライブにしようと\nアイディアを出し、フォローし合う。目指す\nはただひとつ、最高のステージのみ！", "zh": "首都地区的首轮巡演也即将进入尾声，在最后一场公演前进行总彩排的当天。成员们为了正式演出，纷纷提出意见、互相支持，希望把演唱会办得更好。目标只有一个，那就是最棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8d2ad74ba11316da2fe5f65574ec0cfb414d3f700337045561dd70de6ad69314", "ja": "（首都エリア、最初のツアーもいよいよ終盤。\n『RisingLight』最後の公演が開幕される……）", "zh": "（首都地区的首次巡演也终于接近尾声。『RisingLight』的最后一场公演即将开幕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "4147ba6c7c8fb09c41e62acf543e84e27920d44b4166a15aa73252a13c5f766c", "ja": "リハーサルやってみたけど……みんな、どうだった？\n不安なところは、今のうちに潰さないとね。", "zh": "排练试过了……大家觉得怎么样？\n有不安的地方，得趁现在把它们解决掉才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "9cd3ae0732e7a29ebb6fc1d29d3316fe0e0123441c108fed790e81c94ff1c86a", "ja": "ばっちりです～。\n全体の流れも、きちんと頭に入りましたよ～。", "zh": "非常顺利～  \n整体流程也已经牢牢记在脑海里了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7d3ed6a19ed5a995ded19bbe6d534798ab4c03daf4d4410eb617e76555beb9d3", "ja": "思ったんですけど、MCって、新曲の手前に\n入れたほうがタイミング良くないですか？", "zh": "我想了一下，把MC放在新歌前面，\n时机不是会更合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "dc4e2da87c640b745618f82eb8516d017f95b67abe4ae0acc3c82517866ad03b", "ja": "でもそれだと、翼は曲とMCで\n出番が連続することになりますわ。", "zh": "不过那样的话，翼的歌曲和MC就会连续登场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b357c2ffb61f18233dcea5b555340bc77dd27b1e8017ee5bb36630b0aae6cb1f", "ja": "そうなんです。\n翼、頑張るのはいいけど、無理は……。", "zh": "就是这样。\n翼，努力是好事，但别勉强自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "618aecd98fbe8acc83f26def45d748d1c4b5ee56f91cd75bb95dabeb700ee146", "ja": "無理じゃないですよ～？　それに、真さんのこと\n考えたらそっちのほうがいいかなって。", "zh": "这不算勉强啦～？而且，考虑到真，我觉得那样更好嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "80c71485eeb4d4d4fb43982fc130d72997b1fbc42205a15f4b8585617bd3c378", "ja": "えっ、ボク？", "zh": "诶，我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b01f8d273dfc4b63b08accef1f0342d0a4602e4f7baf47658fdc956c3afa6827", "ja": "この日の着替えは、真さんが一番多いでしょ？\nまわりでサポートしたほうがいいかなって。", "zh": "这天要换的衣服，真前辈是最多的吧？\n我想着要不要在旁边帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "b6c0d4a1dc6f3fbf75cac3047554b068c2d0de656d4632c07a3b3b1fb4cc6941", "ja": "あっ、そうだね。この後もだいぶバタバタするから、\nここでMCは助かるかも……。", "zh": "啊，对哦。接下来也会忙得不可开交，\n现在由我来主持MC，或许能帮上忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fb1c00f48bbaf974841e870d4bb2ec2b2bec29f33986bff79a6888a9eca0539c", "ja": "MCのパートはお客さんにも振ったりして、\nちゃんと考えてやるつもりですから！", "zh": "MC环节我也会跟观众互动的，\n我打算好好规划着来做哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ab7e5043a8f967a57047b684a44e17cbfce5aa18f30e327378872309323355f7", "ja": "翼がバランスを取ってくれるなら、\nそっちのがぐっと安定はするな……。", "zh": "如果让翼来帮忙保持平衡，那样确实会稳定得多……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "431b72facadc552c035f110d8a4a516a54b13c5461825936b04bcfab9ca5b6fe", "ja": "それなら……わたくしも、翼と一緒にMCを\n務めますわ。それなら、負担も減るのではなくて？", "zh": "这样的话……我也和翼一起担任主持吧。这样一来，负担不也能减轻吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "52695c49d0c6117b3601076d47aada4e16f9e3ba108647b26adc0d3448e70e5d", "ja": "おお～。千鶴さんならこのきらびやかな会場でも\n見劣りしませんから、安心ですな～。", "zh": "哦哦～。如果是千鹤小姐，在这个华丽的会场里也完全不会逊色，真是让人放心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "c49a76bde99a89e787be0c8b6edd3c000c85760e5de09774a14aaf8b0a1bc84e", "ja": "も、もちろん！　気品あふれるMCをご覧にいれて\nみせますわ！　お～ほっほっほ、ゲホッ、ゴホッ！", "zh": "当、当然！我会为大家展现充满高雅气质的主持风采！哦——呵呵呵，咳、咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "1901c37bf31c2faa5bbc4b0018ebb120ed9beab6cf732565dd92f71cbcd63373", "ja": "セトリには、振り付けや歌詞が頭に入ってる曲も\nありますし……私も、お手伝いできそうですよ～。", "zh": "歌单里也有一些连舞蹈动作和歌词都已经记在脑海里的歌曲……我应该也能帮上忙哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "8aec51f1c1d206d349eeedb45ab7321d7b64d440976fb6cc7dc7e117d5b418f0", "ja": "そういうことなら……みんなに頼っちゃおうかな。\n{$P$}、他のみんなとも相談を……。", "zh": "既然这样的话……那就拜托大家了。\n{$P$}，也和其他人商量一下……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1017_p", "source_sha256": "241951fb6578c88c973dc9e0343a8f68702013b138c516b04cfa83163eba7ea2", "ja": "ああ、すぐ調整しよう。\n翼、ナイスフォローだった。ありがとう！", "zh": "啊，我马上协调一下。\n翼，补救得漂亮。谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3f39b5006988e819395ea08e6de2a3fefc2dfc4aa5e71993f5e04a4588d9e164", "ja": "まかせてくださ～い。その代わり……\n終わったら、ごほうびくださいね～♪", "zh": "交给我吧～不过作为交换……\n结束后，要给我奖励哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_08_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f68d5b3ce6d3e7ee43b96bc5b5110dfba776900b5e50e8ac6f569d20003c5a91", "ja": "（みんな慣れてきて、視野が広がってる。こっちも\n気を抜かず、最高のライブを目指さないとな！）", "zh": "（大家都渐渐习惯了，视野也变开阔了。我们这边也不能放松，要以最棒的演唱会为目标才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
